f":1.0}},"df":1}}}}}}}}}}}},"documentStore":{"save":true,"docs":{"https://abridge.netlify.app/":{"body":"","description":"","id":"https://abridge.netlify.app/","title":""},"https://abridge.netlify.app/about/":{"body":"Zerokoan Research is a personal archive of security research.\nFar be it for me to explain what a Buddhist koan is, but Zerokoan came from an early understanding of what they signify: Abandonment of analytical reason to transcend logic, forcing awareness through intuition over intellect. This is more than likely both an incorrect and glib explanation. Zerokoan is the opposite: Knowing what and why, right now.\nUltimately, it's a doomed endeavor. I'm sure that's obvious, but I was nothing if not obstinate in my youth. I still am, but I was then, too. I'm not sure I can ever leave behind the need to know everything.\nGuided by V.A.U.L.T. research methodology principles:\nValidated\nActionable\nUnflinching\nLinked\nTransparent\nThis site built with Zola, using the Abridge theme created by Jake G (jieiku). Abridge is licensed under the MIT license.","description":"","id":"https://abridge.netlify.app/about/","title":"About"},"https://abridge.netlify.app/archive/":{"body":"","description":"","id":"https://abridge.netlify.app/archive/","title":""},"https://abridge.netlify.app/blog/":{"body":"","description":"","id":"https://abridge.netlify.app/blog/","title":""},"https://abridge.netlify.app/blog/260405-the-resurrection/":{"body":"With an organizational restructure, I am untethered once again. So I'm bringing this back. Though it's been long enough, that everything has been razed and is reborn anew. Very much a work in progress right now; but aren't we all?\nYes, we are.","description":"Back up in your [cash], it's the resurrection","id":"https://abridge.netlify.app/blog/260405-the-resurrection/","title":"The Resurrection"},"https://abridge.netlify.app/blog/260417-intention/":{"body":"If not obvious, this whole thing is very much under construction, with constant change both threatened and delivered.\nMost of what I'd worked on previously is just hilariously out of date or just in need of major revision, so I've elected to remove it all and start anew.\nSecurity research focused on helping Blue by imitating Red, before Redactual can do any damage. Breaking is easy; building is so much more difficult.\nCurrently, overall categories I'm lumping research under:\nRed Team\nKind of a catchall for something that's related to Red Team operations. Some things will fall under other, more specific categories as well\nWeb Assessment\nThink GWAPT and OSWA\nNetwork Assessment\nGPEN, OSCP\nReconnaissance\nOSINT, attack surface mapping, etc\nAI\nGetting into the grift before I'm adrift\nVulnerabilities\nGXPN\nThreat Intelligence\nAPTs, Kill Chains, etc. Not really focused on IOCs, but more the techniques and tooling used","description":"Statement of Intention for what happens near and far","id":"https://abridge.netlify.app/blog/260417-intention/","title":"Intention"},"https://abridge.netlify.app/contact/":{"body":"Want to get in touch? Fill out the form below to send me a message and I will get back to you as soon as possible!\nName\nEmail Address\nMessage\nSend","description":"To reach us please use the contact form on this page.","id":"https://abridge.netlify.app/contact/","title":"Contact"},"https://abridge.netlify.app/images/":{"body":"","description":"","id":"https://abridge.netlify.app/images/","title":""},"https://abridge.netlify.app/offline/":{"body":"Offline Mode\nSorry, no cache found and it looks like you’re offline, a connection is required.","description":"","id":"https://abridge.netlify.app/offline/","title":"Offline Mode"},"https://abridge.netlify.app/pages/":{"body":"","description":"","id":"https://abridge.netlify.app/pages/","title":""},"https://abridge.netlify.app/privacy/":{"body":"Privacy\nThis site does not set or use cookies.\nThis site does not store data in the browser to be shared, sent, or sold to third-parties.\nNo personal information is shared, sent, or sold to third-parties.\nEffective Date: 1st Jan 2022","description":"This page outlines the Privacy Policy for this site, and the date at which this policy was put into affect.","id":"https://abridge.netlify.app/privacy/","title":"Privacy Policy"}},"docInfo":{"https://abridge.netlify.app/":{"body":0,"description":0,"title":0},"https://abridge.netlify.app/about/":{"body":80,"description":0,"title":0},"https://abridge.netlify.app/archive/":{"body":0,"description":0,"title":0},"https://abridge.netlify.app/blog/":{"body":0,"description":0,"title":0},"https://abridge.netlify.app/blog/260405-the-resurrection/":{"body":24,"description":5,"title":1},"https://abridge.netlify.app/blog/260417-intention/":{"body":102,"description":5,"title":1},"https://abridge.netlify.app/contact/":{"body":16,"description":6,"title":1},"https://abridge.netlify.app/images/":{"body":0,"description":0,"title":0},"https://abridge.netlify.app/offline/":{"body":10,"description":0,"title":2},"https://abridge.netlify.app/pages/":{"body":0,"description":0,"title":0},"https://abridge.netlify.app/privacy/":{"body":26,"description":9,"title":2}},"length":11},"lang":"English"}